<!-- Churn's mark on the adaptive icon's 108 dp canvas: a C, cut once. The C
     is a ring 12 wide around a radius of 21.5, centered at (55.5, 54), open
     by 90° to the right, with round ends. A band 5 wide through its center,
     rising 15° to the right, cuts it, and the two pieces are slid 3.5 apart
     along the band. Nothing reaches farther than 31.7 from the canvas's
     center, so it stays inside the 66 dp circle that no launcher's mask cuts
     into. -->
